{"title":{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"快速傅里叶变换和雷德算法"}]},"ast":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"这是一篇旧文，当时采用 tex 编写的，仅将其编译成的 "},{"type":"linkReference","identifier":"doc-pdf","label":"doc-pdf","referenceType":"full","children":[{"type":"text","value":"PDF 挂在此处"}]},{"type":"text","value":"。"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"children":[{"type":"text","value":"小记"}],"identifier":"heading-小记"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"说起来，实在要感谢 lyl 学长（可能他并不想我写上他的名字，以下以他常用的名字\nSparklingWind 指代）。大一的时候看了 SparklingWind 的《高中生学 FFT 算法》，当时自己实在太弱（虽然现在还是弱。。）以至于看得云里雾里。后来 SparklingWind 教我用 LaTeX，实在是让我受益匪浅。LaTeX 是一款精致的排版系统，可以漂亮、准确的表达出你心中所想。于是，我决定要基于自己的理解用 LaTeX 写一份 FFT 的学习笔记云云的东西，我把它命令为 SomethingAboutFFT\n"},{"type":"footnoteReference","label":"1","identifier":"footnote-1"},{"type":"text","value":"，初衷是担心 LaTeX 这种软件对中文名不友好。。。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"当时写了一份类似注解一样的东西，好像有 7 页，但是代码十分恶心。。之后随着对 LaTeX 学习的深入，又几经修改。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"直到 2015 年暑假的一天晚上突然来了灵感把 "},{"type":"linkReference","identifier":"hnu-10004-problem","label":"hnu-10004-problem","referenceType":"full","children":[{"type":"text","value":"HNU10004"}]},{"type":"text","value":" 给过了\n"},{"type":"footnoteReference","label":"2","identifier":"footnote-2"},{"type":"text","value":"，心情大好，决定重写这份文档。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"真的很用心的去完成它，希望你能喜欢。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"这是一篇旧文，当时采用 tex 编写的，Markdown 不能完全识别 LaTeX 代码，所以谨附上其编译成的 "},{"type":"linkReference","identifier":"doc-pdf","label":"doc-pdf","referenceType":"full","children":[{"type":"text","value":"PDF"}]},{"type":"text","value":"，以纪念这段寻常的往事。"}]}]},"frontmatter":{"title":"快速傅里叶变换和雷德算法","createdAt":"2016-04-10T13:24:45.000Z","updatedAt":"2021-11-03T05:57:24.000Z","tags":["acm","大数乘法","fft","快速傅里叶变换"]},"definitionMap":{"doc-pdf":{"type":"definition","identifier":